### 11. 给回答投赞成票（value: 1 赞成 / -1 反对 / 0 撤销；PUT 幂等）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/votes
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}

{
  "targetType": "ANSWER",
  "targetId": {{answerId}},
  "value": 1
}

> {%
    client.test("投票成功", function () {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "投票失败：" + response.status + "，响应：" + response.body);
        client.assert(response.body.myVote === 1, "我的票应为 1");
        client.assert(response.body.scoreDelta === 1, "得分增量应为 +1");
    });
%}


### 12. 重复投同一票（幂等：不再加分，scoreDelta 必须为 0）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/votes
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}

{
  "targetType": "ANSWER",
  "targetId": {{answerId}},
  "value": 1
}

> {%
    client.test("重复投票幂等", function () {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "重复投票失败：" + response.status);
        client.assert(response.body.scoreDelta === 0, "重复投相同票不应再加减分");
    });
%}


### 13. 改投反对票（value: -1，scoreDelta 应为 -2）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/votes
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}

{
  "targetType": "ANSWER",
  "targetId": {{answerId}},
  "value": -1
}

> {%
    client.test("改投成功", function () {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "改投失败：" + response.status);
        client.assert(response.body.scoreDelta === -2, "从 +1 改到 -1，得分增量应为 -2");
    });
%}


### 14. 撤销投票（value: 0，scoreDelta 应为 +1）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/votes
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}

{
  "targetType": "ANSWER",
  "targetId": {{answerId}},
  "value": 0
}

> {%
    client.test("撤销投票成功", function () {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "撤销失败：" + response.status);
        client.assert(response.body.myVote === 0, "撤销后我的票应为 0");
        client.assert(response.body.scoreDelta === 1, "撤销 -1 票应回补 +1");
    });
%}


### 15. 重新投赞成票（让回答最终带着 1 张赞成票进详情页）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/votes
Content-Type: application/json
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}

{
  "targetType": "ANSWER",
  "targetId": {{answerId}},
  "value": 1
}

> {%
    client.test("重新投票成功", function () {
        client.assert(response.status === 200, "投票失败：" + response.status);
        client.assert(response.body.myVote === 1, "我的票应为 1");
    });
%}


### 16. 对回答发表评论（正文 ≤500 字；支持 @昵称，由 Discovery 解析并提醒）
